    <string name="email_help_title">Not sure what an \"app password\" is?</string>
    <string name="email_help_steps">1. Turn on 2-Step Verification on your Google Account (if you haven\'t already).\n2. Tap the button below to open Google\'s app passwords page.\n3. Create a password with any name (e.g. \"Casshole\") and paste it into the \"App password\" field above.\n\nUsing a different email provider (not Gmail)? Look for \"app password\" in your account\'s security settings.</string>
